desc(
	mode: "ssa"
	language: "javascript"
	title: "数据流：Node.js 开放重定向：用户输入作为跳转目标"
	title_zh: "数据流：Node.js 开放重定向：用户输入作为跳转目标"
	type: vuln
	level: ""
	rule_id: "ssa-js-open-redirect"
	risk: "open-redirect"
	cwe: "CWE-601"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
用户可控数据直接作为 `res.redirect` 的目标；仅按前缀过滤的 phi 目标仍可被构造为外部地址。

### 风险类型
open-redirect
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
跳转目标使用服务端映射表（如 `home` → `/home`），不要直接使用请求参数。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	'file://app.js': <<<POS
function go(req, res) {
  res.redirect(req.query.next);
}
module.exports = go;
POS
	'safefile://app-safe.js': <<<NEG
function go(req, res) {
  res.redirect("/home");
}
module.exports = go;
NEG
)

<include('js-param')> as $params;
/(?i)(startsWith|endsWith|includes|has|test|match|indexOf|equals|parse|resolve)/ as $guards;

res.redirect(* as $arg)
res.location(* as $arg)

$arg?{<self> #{
    include: <<<CODE
* & $params as $__next__
CODE,
}->}?{!opcode: phi} as $hit

alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Node.js 开放重定向：用户输入作为跳转目标",
	title_zh: "Node.js 开放重定向：用户输入作为跳转目标",
	risk: "open-redirect",
}
